# course robot plan, revision A (pretend values; cite= names the datasheet section)
part mcu 3.0 3.6 4.0 cite=D2:operating-conditions
part imu 1.7 3.6 4.0 cite=D3:electrical-characteristics
part mag 1.7 3.6 4.0 cite=D4:electrical-characteristics
part motor_driver 4.5 5.5 6.0 cite=D5:recommended-operating-conditions
part encoder_L 3.0 5.5 6.0 cite=D6:electrical
part lidar 4.75 5.25 5.5
rail 3V3 3.3 0.50 cite=D7:regulator-output
rail 5V 5.0 3.00 cite=D8:regulator-output
power mcu 3V3 0.08 cite=D2:supply-current
power imu 3V3 0.01 cite=D3:supply-current
power mag 3V3 0.01 cite=D4:supply-current
power encoder_L 3V3 0.02 cite=D6:supply-current
power motor_driver 5V 0.02 cite=D5:supply-current
power lidar 5V 0.60 cite=D9:power
signal ENC_L_A encoder_L mcu 2.9 3.3 0.4 2.3 1.0 4.0 cite=D6:output,D2:io-levels
signal MOT_EN mcu motor_driver 2.9 3.3 0.4 2.0 0.8 6.0 cite=D2:io-levels,D5:logic-inputs
i2c i2c1 imu 0x68 cite=D3:i2c-address
i2c i2c1 mag 0x1E cite=D4:i2c-address
